      "content": "it doesn't feel like anxiety tho. anxiety is a feeling in your head, this is... physical. it feels like my body is literally tuning into a different frequency. like i'm becoming more sensitive to things that were always there, but i'm just finally catching up to them. it's like a latent part of me is waking up.",
