    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just hard to accept the \"neurological change\" angle because it feels so purposeful. like, if my body is changing to perceive these frequencies, what happens if i keep pushing against them? i feel like if i can just find a way to dampen the outside noise—like sensory deprivation or staying in a very controlled, quiet environment—i could actually figure out how to harness this. do you think there's a way to structure a regimen to help me accelerate this process without getting overwhelmed?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
